{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh3opprcpyS1aLJDYxga","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fo6Ls6k8JreDFSWeDzvuo7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> NOTES.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Progress log (keep current)\n\n- DONE (sim, headless): src/00-core, 01-math, 02-weapons, 03-enemies, 04-sim, 05-sim-enemies, 06-sim-boss,\n  07-world, 10-stages (3 stages + range). Smoke-tested: area progression, waves, threats, lives.\n- DONE (presentation, unverified in browser): 21-raster, 22-art, 23-fx, 30-audio, 40-input, 41-play, 42-hud.\n- TODO: 31-story (cues, intros, E.Dialog), 43-screens (title, menus, select, briefing, results, records, about,\n  howto, touch-only notice, initials via E.Arcade), 44-dev (dev panel), 45-attract (Autopilot + playlist),\n  46-hub (AI Hub shared-world host/replica), 50-main (E.Game, scenes, settings, boot), tools/about-data.json,\n  src/html-head.html (done), tests (sim, input, build, playthrough), index.html dev page.\n- Engine patches: 1 (glyphs) applied. Pending: 2 (wheel codes), 3 (audio buses) only if needed.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Update working notes with progress"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1039,"cache_read_input_tokens":314356,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1039},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2","uuid":"8a8fa335-ea3b-4ccd-8512-ecd5c9ad8af6","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:50:36.428Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh3opVXJwp269CpRBvgZ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Fo6Ls6k8JreDFSWeDzvuo7":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183312__xf5fb84/work/SublimeCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-183312 && cat >> NOTES.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Progress log (keep current)\n\n- DONE (sim, headless): src/00-core, 01-math, 02-weapons, 03-enemies, 04-sim, 05-sim-enemies, 06-sim-boss,\n  07-world, 10-stages (3 stages + range). Smoke-tested: area progression, waves, threats, lives.\n- DONE (presentation, unverified in browser): 21-raster, 22-art, 23-fx, 30-audio, 40-input, 41-play, 42-hud.\n- TODO: 31-story (cues, intros, E.Dialog), 43-screens (title, menus, select, briefing, results, records, about,\n  howto, touch-only notice, initials via E.Arcade), 44-dev (dev panel), 45-attract (Autopilot + playlist),\n  46-hub (AI Hub shared-world host/replica), 50-main (E.Game, scenes, settings, boot), tools/about-data.json,\n  src/html-head.html (done), tests (sim, input, build, playthrough), index.html dev page.\n- Engine patches: 1 (glyphs) applied. Pending: 2 (wheel codes), 3 (audio buses) only if needed.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Update working notes with progress"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01Fo6Ls6k8JreDFSWeDzvuo7":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183312__xf5fb84/work/SublimeCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-183312"}}}
