{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh4A42AG4SxJ2rUxnznk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The runner works, and the failures are real findings. Three bugs:\n\n1. **Exposed enemies are hidden by their own nest wall.** The wall stands between an enemy and the player even when the enemy has stepped out to fire, so players could only hit the head. Exposed enemies should be targetable past their own wall.\n2. **Civilians block the area from clearing.** They walk forever, so an area with a civilian never ends. Civilians should not count toward clearing.\n3. The \"rides in\" check was timed too late. The arrival is 2.2 seconds, so the test needs a shorter wait.\n\nI'll fix the two sim bugs and the test timing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3751,"cache_read_input_tokens":376056,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3751},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2","uuid":"b8ef0669-3ba9-44f5-9e21-308d76682250","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:55:16.656Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh4A3ko3N5fZguviJwPF"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh4A42AG4SxJ2rUxnznk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JFt8hdup86vRXtpsqNHtMs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for old,new in pairs:\n        n=s.count(old)\n        assert n==1, (p, n, old[:80])\n        s=s.replace(old,new)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/04-sim.js', [\n(\"\"\"    for (const b of this.world.boxes) {\n      if (!b.solid) continue;\n      const t = TC.rayBox(o, d, b.b);\n      if (t >= 0) consider(t, { kind: 'box', box: b });\n    }\"\"\",\"\"\"    // An enemy that has stepped out to fire leans past its own nest wall: that wall does not hide it.\n    const leaning = new Set(this.enemies.filter(e => e.alive && e.exposed && e.nest).map(e => e.nest));\n    for (const b of this.world.boxes) {\n      if (!b.solid) continue;\n      if (b.nest && leaning.has(b.nest)) continue;\n      const t = TC.rayBox(o, d, b.b);\n      if (t >= 0) consider(t, { kind: 'box', box: b });\n    }\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  updateWaves() {\n    const actionT = this.phaseT;\n    const alive = () => this.enemies.filter(e => e.alive && e.role !== 'boss').length;\"\"\",\"\"\"  updateWaves() {\n    const actionT = this.phaseT;\n    // The field is clear when no combatant is alive: civilians walk on and never count (plan 4.10).\n    const alive = () => this.enemies.filter(e => e.alive && e.role !== 'boss' && e.role !== 'civilian').length;\"\"\"),\n])\npatch('tests/sim.test.mjs', [\n(\"\"\"    steps(sim, TC.CLEAR_T + TC.ARRIVE + 0.2);\n    check('the next area rides in after the clear', sim.sceneIdx === 1 && sim.phase === 'arrive', `scene=${sim.sceneIdx} phase=${sim.phase}`);\"\"\",\n\"\"\"    steps(sim, TC.CLEAR_T + 0.3);\n    check('the next area rides in after the clear', sim.sceneIdx === 1 && sim.phase === 'arrive', `scene=${sim.sceneIdx} phase=${sim.phase}`);\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    check('the stage result has ranks and accuracy', sim.result.rows[0].rank && sim.result.rows[0].shots > 0, JSON.stringify(sim.result.rows[0]));\"\"\",\n\"\"\"    check('the stage result has ranks and accuracy', !!sim.result && !!sim.result.rows[0].rank && sim.result.rows[0].shots > 0, JSON.stringify(sim.result && sim.result.rows[0]));\"\"\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\nexport TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp && timeout 300 node tests/run.mjs; echo \"exit $?\"","description":"Fix leaning enemies, civilian clear rule, and test timing"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3751,"cache_read_input_tokens":376056,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3751},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2","uuid":"f6a292cb-6c36-4ca4-8c57-45e49c252f77","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:55:20.375Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh4A3ko3N5fZguviJwPF","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JFt8hdup86vRXtpsqNHtMs":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183312__xf5fb84/work/SublimeCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-183312 && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\ndef patch(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for old,new in pairs:\n        n=s.count(old)\n        assert n==1, (p, n, old[:80])\n        s=s.replace(old,new)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\npatch('src/04-sim.js', [\n(\"\"\"    for (const b of this.world.boxes) {\n      if (!b.solid) continue;\n      const t = TC.rayBox(o, d, b.b);\n      if (t >= 0) consider(t, { kind: 'box', box: b });\n    }\"\"\",\"\"\"    // An enemy that has stepped out to fire leans past its own nest wall: that wall does not hide it.\n    const leaning = new Set(this.enemies.filter(e => e.alive && e.exposed && e.