{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh4cMXr38xQogunZdhjy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The in-play screen renders: enemy billboards show above their walls, the reticle and hit marker work, and the weapon panel and lives show. The error panel is only the About data problem.\n\nReviewing the flow against TASK.md turned up real gaps I need to close:\n- **Touch-only gear:** the notice shows text, not a working settings button.\n- **Co-op never joins a second player**, because nothing calls `allowJoin`.\n- **The intel count** says 6, but the stages contain 4 bottles.\n- **The dev panel** lacks the plan's \"Bot plays\" action.\n\nI'll fix those, along with a guard on the About data."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1751,"cache_read_input_tokens":432928,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1751},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2","uuid":"88237d8a-6565-4bba-807b-4f5440d27748","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:01:13.441Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh4cMAmU8uac2QTB2xjt"}
