er === 'attract' ? 0 : 1));\"\"\",\"\"\"process.exit(errors.length ? 1 : (info.touchOnly && info.touchEnabledAfter === false && after === 'attract' ? 0 : 1));\"\"\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs --html >/dev/null && export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp && timeout 250 node tools/touchcheck.mjs; echo \"exit $?\"","description":"Disable touch on the title and poll for attract on phones"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_0148bUxUoPiaP8SpuMmkPuTR":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183312__xf5fb84/work/SublimeCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-183312"}}}
