{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh5tP8QEiKh2dFuhUbLR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 134 checks pass. Before I rebuild the HTML and rerun the browser checks, I need to be accurate about what I've built. The roster now covers all 14 of the plan's enemy types. The ride is a simplified carrier: the camera moves along a path, but there's no boat mesh and no enemies riding it. Several type-specific details are still simplified: the drone and jet-ski use human rigs rather than their own meshes, and the jet-ski's ski explosion and the captor's hostage penalty aren't built. I'll record those in the final report. Now the browser checks."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":545121,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2","uuid":"ed5f19b5-d713-4d20-bb62-6e2c245ae61b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:17:47.509Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh5tNkKvvW8FWNmUwobB"}
